  "editor_review": "Are you prepared to command humanity's stand against the zombie menace? Age of Origins presents an exciting zombie strategy MMO where you'll gather armies, vanquish swarms of the undead, and restore civilization. With over 70 million copies downloaded globally, this game combines strategy, cooperation, and fierce combat. Survive by assembling troops of human fighters, machine guns, and futuristic laser cannons. Revitalize society by recapturing your city piece by piece, assisting survivors, and witnessing the transformation of the world map. Flourish by forging alliances, participating in monumental clan conflicts, and taking control of the landscape. Can you rise to the challenge, Commander? The battle for survival starts now!",
